      "body" : [
        "Brackwater",
        {
          "NSInlinePresentationIntent" : 2
        },
        " is the largest town on the coast. Its lower streets flood at spring tides, and the oldest cellars are said to open into the drowned city beneath. The harbor is run by ",
        {

        },
        "Captain Odric Vane",
        {
          "NSLink" : {
            "relative" : "encounter:\/\/page\/97729D51-426A-4944-90BF-F4EEEE2C04BE"
          }
        },
        " and the ",
        {

        },
        "Harbor Guild",
        {
          "NSLink" : {
            "relative" : "encounter:\/\/page\/FF5C50F6-B9E6-4C0A-8CA3-6D9F2627C5A9"
          }
        },
        ", and every job starts at ",
        {

        },
        "The Gilded Gull",
        {
          "NSLink" : {
            "relative" : "encounter:\/\/page\/87101B95-622F-4933-B0F5-4B697A5920C0"
          }
        },
        ".",
